Description:
A component of the servo web-engine.

Local Modifications:
Updated with tools/import.py servo (history replayed linearly); how far behind it is: `bun testing/acceptance.ts track`.
The crates (78) live in third_party/servo/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by tools/flatten.py
(path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate). Lockfiles of the upstream are not kept.
Patches: none. Integration fixes: yes, in tools/fixups.sh.
Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/servo/ unchanged. Not imported: tests/wpt/tests.

